    {
      "heading": "Specifications",
      "source_text": "- Resolution: 4K (3,840 x 2,160)\n- Aspect Ratio: 16:9\n- Brightness (Typical): 350cd/㎡\n- Contrast Ratio Static: 1000:1(Typ)\n- Response Time: 5ms\n- Refresh Rate: Max 60Hz\n- Viewing Angle (Horizontal/Vertical): 178°/178°",
