      "source_file": "sources/samsung/displays/viewfinity-s8-s80ud-27-inch-source.md"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Display",
      "source_text": "- Screen Size (Class): 27\n- Flat / Curved: Flat\n- Active Display Size (HxV) (mm): 596.736mm(H) x 335.664mm(V)\n- Aspect Ratio: 16:9\n- Panel Type: IPS\n- Brightness (Typical): 350 cd/㎡\n- Brightness (Min): 280 cd/㎡\n- Contrast Ratio Static: 1000:1(Typ)\n- Contrast Ratio (Dynamic): Mega ∞ DCR\n- HDR(High Dynamic Range): HDR10\n- Resolution: 4K (3,840 x 2,160)\n- Response Time: 5ms\n- Viewing Angle (Horizontal/Vertical): 178°/178°\n- Colour Support: Max 1.07B\n- sRGB Coverage: 99% (Typ)\n- Refresh Rate: Max 60Hz",
      "source_url": "https://www.samsung.com/uk/monitors/high-resolution/viewfinity-s8-27-inch-uhd-usb-type-c-ls27d800uauxxu/",
      "source_file": "sources/samsung/displays/viewfinity-s8-s80ud-27-inch-source.md"
    },
    {
      "heading": "General Feature",
      "source_text": "- Eye Saver Mode: Yes\n- Flicker Free: Yes\n- Picture-In-Picture: Yes\n- Picture-By-Picture: Yes\n- Image Size: Yes\n- Windows Certification: Windows11\n- Off Timer Plus: Yes\n- Auto Source Switch: Auto Source Switch+\n- Adaptive Picture: Yes\n- KVM Switch: Yes",
      "source_url": "https://www.samsung.com/uk/monitors/high-resolution/viewfinity-s8-27-inch-uhd-usb-type-c-ls27d800uauxxu/",
